  "schema": "focused-lean-evidence-v1",
  "scope": "Three focused deterministic event/read adapters. LiteralQueryBinding identifies a successful row-31 query event with a finite-set containment event under explicit valid/data/decode premises; LiteralQueryCurrentRead locates a successfully decoded query at the current row-31 extension; LiteralRhoBinding identifies a successful row-32 rho event with the residual-set predicate under explicit valid/data/query-reader premises. No acceptance, extraction, or security conclusion is asserted.",
